  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Polygon -- Ethereum's leading L2 scaling solution offering EVM compatibility, dramatically lower fees, and near-instant finality. Stores OASIS holons, avatars, and NFTs on Polygon PoS or zkEVM with full Ethereum interoperability. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture -- 55+ networks. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
